      "writtenOn": "2021-04-02T08:07:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Serialization doesnt fix the issue here. The cause of concern is the duplicate setPreferredDataModem requests. When DDS is already set to a SIM, it is not proper to send setPreferredDataModem request on the same SIM multiple times right?\n\nFor legacy setDataAllowed requests, there is a active flag check to block duplicate requests. We should have a similar check for setPreferredDataModem requests too.\nThe CL uploaded is doing the same. It sets the flag when setPreferredDataModem is success, and resets flag wherever that request must be sent again",
